flowchart TD
    A[Worker calls complete_task] --> B{Has commits?}
    B -->|Yes| C{autoMerge?}
    B -->|No| D[Record output only]
    C -->|Yes| E[Merge to main]
    C -->|No| F[Show for approval]
    F -->|Approved| E
    F -->|Rejected| G[Keep branch]
    E --> H[TaskStore completed]
    D --> H
    H --> I[Notify Planner]
    I --> J[Cleanup clone]
